sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor StationOwner as User / station owner
participant API as API service
participant MeasurementsController
participant GetStationByIdService
participant StationRepository as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
participant RecordMeasurementService
participant MeasurementAggregate as Measurement aggregate
participant MeasurementRepository as IMeasurementRepository / MongoMeasurementRepository
participant Publisher as RabbitMqAlertPublisherAdapter
participant RabbitMQ
participant Consumer as RabbitMqClimateAlertConsumerAdapter
participant NotificationService
participant ProfileRepository as INotificationProfileRepository / MongoNotificationProfileRepository
participant AlertNotifier as Composite/Log/Telegram AlertNotifier

StationOwner->>API: POST /measurements
API->>MeasurementsController: route with JWT user
MeasurementsController->>GetStationByIdService: execute({ stationId })
GetStationByIdService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
StationRepository-->>GetStationByIdService: station
GetStationByIdService-->>MeasurementsController: station
MeasurementsController->>MeasurementsController: ensure station owner matches JWT subject
MeasurementsController->>RecordMeasurementService: execute(command)
RecordMeasurementService->>StationRepository: findById(stationId)
StationRepository-->>RecordMeasurementService: station with alert settings
RecordMeasurementService->>MeasurementAggregate: Measurement.create(..., alertSettings)
MeasurementAggregate-->>RecordMeasurementService: measurement with evaluated alert
RecordMeasurementService->>MeasurementRepository: save(measurement)
MeasurementRepository-->>RecordMeasurementService: persisted measurement

alt measurement has alert
  RecordMeasurementService->>Publisher: publishClimateAlert(ClimateAlertDetectedMessage)
  Publisher->>RabbitMQ: publish to weatherflow.alerts with alerts.climate.detected
  RabbitMQ-->>Publisher: confirm publish
  RabbitMQ->>Consumer: deliver ClimateAlertDetectedMessage
  Consumer->>Consumer: validateClimateAlertDetectedMessage(payload)
  Consumer->>NotificationService: handleClimateAlert(message)
  NotificationService->>ProfileRepository: findSubscribersByStationId(stationId)
  ProfileRepository-->>NotificationService: notification profiles
  NotificationService->>NotificationService: Filter subscribers by station and alert type
  NotificationService->>NotificationService: resolve delivery targets before any channel call
  loop each resolved notification
    NotificationService->>AlertNotifier: sendMeasurementAlert(notification)
  end
  AlertNotifier-->>NotificationService: delivery completed
  NotificationService-->>Consumer: success
  Consumer->>RabbitMQ: ack message
else no alert
  RecordMeasurementService-->>MeasurementsController: no message published
end

RecordMeasurementService-->>MeasurementsController: measurement
MeasurementsController-->>StationOwner: 201 MeasurementResponse
